# Roles

Enum `App\Enums\UserRole`: `admin`, `approver`, `lawyer`, `counselor`, `law_enforcer`, `humanitarian`, `user`.

`staffRoles()` is approver, lawyer, counselor, law enforcer, humanitarian. Approvers vote. The other four only see assigned complaints.

- Middleware alias `role` → `EnsureUserHasRole`. Inactive users get 403.
- `DashboardController` redirects each role to its home route.
- New role checklist: enum + label, route group + middleware, dashboard match, admin staff slug, team group, user directory.
